# XcodeGen output — `project.yml` is the source of truth, and every workflow
# that builds this app regenerates the project before it does. Committing the
# result only produced merge conflicts (two branches each registering a new
# source file collide in `project.pbxproj`, which is not hand-mergeable).
# Run `xcodegen generate` before opening Xcode.
#
# `project.xcworkspace/xcshareddata/swiftpm/Package.resolved` stays TRACKED:
# XcodeGen does not produce it, and it is what pins resolved SwiftPM
# dependency versions.
SliccFollower.xcodeproj/project.pbxproj
SliccFollower.xcodeproj/xcshareddata/
SliccFollower.xcodeproj/project.xcworkspace/contents.xcworkspacedata

